==English==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|ang}} {{term|ficol|lang=ang}}. From {{proto|Germanic}} (cf. Old Norse {{term|feikn||portent}}), from {{proto|Indo-European}} (Latin {{term|piget||it irks, displeases}})

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/ˈfɪk.əl/}}, {{SAMPA|/fIk.@l/}}
*: {{audio|en-us-fickle.ogg|Audio (US)}}
*: {{rhymes|ɪkəl}}

